; Materialization corpus: an expression default evaluates against an
; empty Env using closed-vocab special forms — `if` is dispatched by the
; evaluator before any schema lookup, so `(if true 32 0)` reduces to 32
; without `core` being loaded. Schema.validateDefaults defers statically
; (`if` is unresolved at the aggregate phase) and Host.validateDocument
; surfaces no diagnostic; the overlay records `(circle :radius) → 32`
; with `expression_default` origin.
(plugin :name probe :version "1.0.0"
  (form :name circle
    (key :name radius :type number :default (if true 32 0))))

(circle)
